   "translations": [
    {
     "id": 97128,
     "resource_id": 20,
     "text": "So they set out, until when they met a boy, he [i.e., al-Khiḍr] killed him. [Moses] said, \"Have you killed a pure soul for other than [having killed] a soul? You have certainly done a deplorable thing.\""
    }
